    "body": "**Status: The requested explanation is still outstanding.** Knockout exists, but lowering Unarmed damage alone does not guarantee nonlethal punches. Action-specific damage/reactions and shared health/knockout rules both matter.\n\nTrace and explain the actual decision in plain language before proposing settings or a never-kill change. This remains exploratory; no new combat behavior is ready.",
